      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "functional requirement\n1. the system should give information about the parking space for \n   a given vehical type to the user , \n2. the information should be about ... what all floor does have that parking \n3.  it should also display the rate of each parking lot based on the floor it is\n     and the vehical type\n4. we should have multiple payment strategies \n5. we could have multiple access points so no concurrent booking should be there \n\n ",
      "fontSize": 19.409991839063963,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "functional requirement\n1. the system should give information about the parking space for \n   a given vehical type to the user , \n2. the information should be about ... what all floor does have that parking \n3.  it should also display the rate of each parking lot based on the floor it is\n     and the vehical type\n4. we should have multiple payment strategies \n5. we could have multiple access points so no concurrent booking should be there \n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
