      "text": "//its job is to get data about the floor\n// like availibity booking \nFloorService \n\nprivate:\n// { level , floor class itslef}\nunordered_map < int , *Floor> floors ;\nPlotService *pservice ;\nint totLevel ;\n\npublic:\n\nvoid addFloors ( Floot *f , int level ) {\n    floors[level] = f ;\n}\n\nvector < int > findAvailables ( EnumType t ) {\n  vector < vector < int >> plots ( totLevel + 1) ;\n    for ( auto floor : floors ) {\n        for ( auto x : floor->posi[t] ) { \n            if (pservice->checkAvailibilty(x) ) {\n                      plots[level].push_back(id) ;\n              }\n          }\n    } \n    \n}\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "//its job is to get data about the floor\n// like availibity booking \nFloorService \n\nprivate:\n// { level , floor class itslef}\nunordered_map < int , *Floor> floors ;\nPlotService *pservice ;\nint totLevel ;\n\npublic:\n\nvoid addFloors ( Floot *f , int level ) {\n    floors[level] = f ;\n}\n\nvector < int > findAvailables ( EnumType t ) {\n  vector < vector < int >> plots ( totLevel + 1) ;\n    for ( auto floor : floors ) {\n        for ( auto x : floor->posi[t] ) { \n            if (pservice->checkAvailibilty(x) ) {\n                      plots[level].push_back(id) ;\n              }\n          }\n    } \n    \n}\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
